at's time to focus on  growing the business not just being in  the business running the business but  big picture growing the business ideas  i like to chunk it in an hour and a half  because i find that those chunks are  it's ideal  for  for workflow i find that if you're  working for more than an hour and a half  your brain starts to shut off  so  i try to focus my efforts on an hour and  a half and i don't allow distractions  nobody has my phone number my phone is  in the closet in in my office i don't  know the phone number from my cell phone  people don't call me i don't get  distracted by email and that gives me  focused chunks so when i'm sitting down  i'm working for an hour and a half i am  working for an hour and a half and  nobody's distracting me from doing what  i have to do and when i'm playing with  my son i'm playing with my son  and nobody's distracting me from  something else i don't take  emails from my office when i'm playing  with my son  how much time you spend working how much  time you spend with your family we all  have to make our own personal decisions  on what to do there  and that's fine  figure it out  drop your calendar  see how much time you want to work on  your business  okay if you're working nine to five if  that's your calendar or you're working  you know ten to eight or whatever it is  plot that out make sure that those times  spent are focused not getting distracted  you're setting boundaries so people can  interrupt you on important things you  have to do and that includes your family  and includes your your staff and your  suppliers  my family all knows that when i'm  working i'm working and not to interrupt  me unless it's an emergency right this  is an emergency if somebody calls me my  family has my cell phone number i'm  picking it up because i know it's an  emergency  but it almost never happens when do we  really get emergencies you know maybe a  couple times a year  so i don't really factor it in  but of course if something comes up i  drop everything else  and you also factor in your family time  or other hobbies that you have i spend  20 25 hours a week doing salsa salsa  dancing djing preparing my list  it's crazy i gotta factor that in i  schedule that  and i don't let things get in the way  with my salsa when i'm out dancing or  djing i'm not answering my emails or  doing other business  so focus set boundaries don't let things  interrupt you most of your time is  wasted from hopping between  different things in a day  you're working on something you're doing  really well at it and then an email  comes in you get distracted you go look  at it or a phone call comes in you get  distracted then you come back to your  email you come back to your project and  what was i working on i don't remember  what i was doing  don't let that happen focus  you have to tell people how you want to  be treated  if you want to book a call with me or  book a meeting with me i send you a link  to my calendar  and you book it in there's no back and  forth on email does this day work does  this day work this time doesn't work for  me  you adapt to my calendar  if you respect your time  other people will respect your time  if you don't then people will walk all  over you so you have to respect your  time you have to set boundaries and you  have to treat your personal life just as  important as your business  believe  for those of you watching you like the  video please give it a thumbs up below  make sure to do more for you and hey i'd  love to hear what you have to think  about this video please leave a comment  below they make my day even if you're  just saying great video evan i love  seeing us come in and if you have a  comment or question for your own company  let me know and i'll create a video  reply for you thank you guys see you  soon
 

